// A dev-tier block naming a tier that is not a built-in (a typo, or a tier the build profile does
// not provide) is an UnknownTier (E0036) — surfaced, not silently dropped, so a misspelled `@tset`
// does not invisibly discard its content. The built-in tiers are `@test`/`@bench`/`@doc`/`@debug`.
// expect: error E0036 at 6:2
// expect: exit 1
@tset {
    fn x() { echo "hi"; }
}
echo 1;
